\n\n👉🏻湯頭：\n醬油雞湯為湯底，因為請店家協助炙燒豬五花叉燒，炙燒後的油脂流入湯中，雖湯頭偏油，但是非常好吃，搭配生洋蔥非常非常清爽，吃到中途將生薑泥拌入後，湯頭的層次又再升級，是因為很適合下雨天陰涼天氣喝上一碗的湯。\n\n👉🏻配料：\n溏心蛋味道相當的濃郁，感覺好像是酒蛋的味道，蛋黃的味道醇濃好讚。豬五花叉燒可選炙燒或不炙燒，個人偏愛炙燒，肉雖然偏肥，但頸鹿先生超愛吃肥肉，這五花肉真的讚到不行，輕鬆就入口，炙燒後香氣相當足夠，很愛。",null,[0,55]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1618156032664939757/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTXlORmxNU1c5blJSQUIQAQ%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1618156032664939757/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTXlORmxNU1c5blJSQUIQAQ%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1618156032664939757/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTXlORmxNU1c5blJSQUIQAQ%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1618156032664939757/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTXlORmxNU1c5blJSQUIQAQ%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1618156032664939757/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTXlORmxNU1c5blJSQUIQAQ%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1618156032664939757/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTXlORmxNU1c5blJSQUIQAQ%3D%3D"]],[null,null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/@/data\u003d!4m7!23m6!1m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMyNFlMSW9nRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x3b1cda6e58c4de32!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC24YLIogE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMyNFlMSW9nRRAB\u0026t\u003d3\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMyNFlMSW9nRRIsChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMyNFlMSVlnEhJDZ3NJeG9pTmt3WVFvT2Z0SnciEgkAAAAAAAAAABEy3sRYbtocOyoLMFhOb0c1M3lyRFY\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjlnLCAs9eWAxVgc_UHHYPMLZcQoykIhwIoAg"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwiJoraAs9eWAxVWbV4EHX5fKxwQ0pMFCL0BKA0"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjlnLCAs9eWAxVgc_UHHYPMLZcQ0pMFCIMCKAU"],[["ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURXNktmU0Z3EAE",["0x0:0x3b1cda6e58c4de32",null,1647256164465198,1647256164465198,[nul